<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{base_url}}/css/tailwind-external.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>tailwind.config={theme:{extend:{colors:{'mcag-slate':'#0f172a','mcag-blue':'#3b82f6',}}}}</script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{base_url}}/assets/expensebar/style.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/feather-icons"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#020617] text-slate-200 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-emerald-500/30 overflow-x-hidden">

    <!-- Global MCAG Navbar -->
    {{> expensebar/navbar}}

    <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-4xl relative z-10 flex-grow">
        <div class="mb-12 text-center animate-fade-in">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Centro Aiuto ExpenseBar</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg">Come possiamo aiutarti con le tue finanze oggi?</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <i data-feather="plus-circle" class="text-emerald-500"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Inserire Spese</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Guida rapida su come tracciare le tue spese quotidiane e categorizzarle correttamente.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-violet-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <i data-feather="pie-chart" class="text-violet-500"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Analytics</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Come leggere i grafici e interpretare i trend annuali per ottimizzare il budget.</p>
            </div>
             <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <i data-feather="download" class="text-blue-500"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Export Dati</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Esporta i tuoi report in PDF o Excel per condividerli o archiviarli.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 4 -->
            <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                    <i data-feather="shield" class="text-amber-500"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Sicurezza</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Scopri come proteggiamo i tuoi dati finanziari con crittografia end-to-end.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Hai bisogno di altro supporto?</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Il nostro team di supporto è disponibile per assisterti con problemi tecnici.</p>
            <button class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold transition-colors">
                Contatta Supporto
            </button>
        </div>

    </main>

    {{> expensebar/footer}}

    <script>
        feather.replace();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
